ph('U18-HELP-SERVANTS','twēntig ðēowa manna / tō ðǣm ðēowum mannum','Twenty enslaved men; to the enslaved men. Keep original ðēowa without r. BT1053 supports the strong noun; BT1054’s adjective quotation actually has þeówra WITH r. The selected contextual strong-noun inference is bounded; no claim excludes every historical adjectival variant.','U18-FB-P176 U18-FB176-DETAIL U18-BT-P1053 U18-BT-P1054','97 98 99 105 106 107 108 192 193 194 195')
