ph('U18-HELP-FAREWELL-ACC','bǣdon hīe gesunde bēon','Wished them to be well: hīe refers to the king and princess and is the accusative actor of bēon; gesunde is accusative plural predicate. The complete construction is supplied.','U18-FB-P176','164 165 166 167')
