ph('U18-HELP-AGENT-ADDRESSES','earmra gemiltsiend / lāre lufiend','Pitier of the poor / lover of learning. Supply both agent nouns and their object genitives. These phrases address the king and princess respectively; historical or Latin parallels in the original notes are explained in English.','U18-FB-P176 U18-EX-P57','179 180 184 185')
